{Prov}_G(v_1)\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{URFN}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,v_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"v_1","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2227,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"统一反射模式与外部全局反射分别见[[92-df-universal-reflection]]和[[92-df-global-reflection]]"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-reflection]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[9